      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">No Perth engineering firm publishes a fee for a crack report, a beam or a patio certificate. Here's what drives the quote, the figures that are published, and the government charges that sit on top. Call now on (08) 5550 6237 to get a quote on your job.</p>
